        <subClassOf xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.ease-crc.org/ont/SOMA.owl#Spoon"/>
        <comment xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A spoon relatively smaller in size used for string a cup of tea or measuring a volume. Specifically for cooking or medicine purposes, the volume is defined as 5ml.</comment>
